  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SJS - communication rights for victims of         sexual violence in DRC - SJS - communication rights sexual violence DRC</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SJS - r&#xe4;tten till kommunikation f&#xf6;r offer f&#xf6;r     sexuellt v&#xe5;ld i DRK</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of information (healthcare, legal assistance, counselling)  to victims of sexual violence. The project uses an anonymous          telephone help service, based on the technology offered by            Freedomfone.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tillhandah&#xe5;llande av information (t.ex. h&#xe4;lsov&#xe5;rd, juridisk hj&#xe4;lp,    psykologiskt st&#xf6;d) f&#xf6;r kvinnor och flickor som fallit offer f&#xf6;r       sexuellt v&#xe5;ld. Projektet anv&#xe4;nder sig av en hj&#xe4;lptelefon som          tillhandahas av Freedomfone.</narrative>
  </description>
